
```html
<!-- Put this inside your .container -->

<div class="buttons">
    <a class="button" href="#">🏠 Home</a>
    <a class="button" href="#about">👤 About</a>
    <a class="button" href="#projects">🚀 Projects</a>
    <a class="button" href="#contact">📧 Contact</a>
</div>
```

```css
/* Put this inside your <style> section */

.buttons {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 15px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 30px 0;
}

.button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 25px;

    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: bold;

    border: 2px solid #00c6ff;
    border-radius: 12px;

    background: rgba(0, 198, 255, 0.08);

    box-shadow:
        0 0 10px #00c6ff;

    transition: 0.3s;
}

.button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.05);

    background: #00c6ff;
    color: #050816;

    box-shadow:
        0 0 15px #00c6ff,
        0 0 35px #00c6ff,
        0 0 60px #0072ff;
}
```
